            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-712] bookkeeper script should use &apos;java&apos; from JAVA_HOME</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-712</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently bookkeeper script is running using the default &apos;java&apos; from the PATH.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But it should check JAVA_HOME and use JAVA_HOME/bin/java&lt;/p&gt;</description>
